    "text": "The equation of a tangent to the parabola, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>y</mi></math>, which makes an angle <math><mi>&#952;</mi></math> with the positive direction of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo></math>&nbsp;axis, is"
  },
